        "explanation": "<p>The accounting equation is: <b>$Assets = Liabilities + Owner's Equity$</b>. Rearranged, <b>$Owner's Equity = Assets - Liabilities$</b>. Thus, $10,000 - $4,000 = $6,000.</p>",
